      "text": "Joseph1 sold into Egypt, 1 Ne. 5:14 (2 Ne. 3:4; 4:1; Alma 10:3). God led Israel out of captivity, out of Egypt, 1 Ne. 5:15 (17:40; 19:10; 2 Ne. 3:10; 21:16; 25:20; Mosiah 7:19; 12:34; Alma 36:28). the Lord shall hiss for fly in uttermost part of Egypt, 2 Ne. 17:18 (Isa. 7:18). Assyrian shall lift up staff against Zion after manner of Egypt, 2 Ne. 20:24, 26 (Isa. 10:24, 26). the Lord shall set his hand second time to recover remnant of his people left in Egypt, 2 Ne. 21:11 (Isa. 11:11). Joseph1 brought father into Egypt, Ether 13:7.",
